{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_779B012B","title":"Banor ask the player about Egress","entry":"Dlg_779B012B::entry","exit":"Dlg_779B012B::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B9758EC2","articyId":"72057645577587257","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Hey boss, you got that ticket to Egress all sorted out now?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey boss, you got that ticket to Egress all sorted out now?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":475.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41918","byteOffset":30185712,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_D5EAD4CC","articyId":"72057645577587271","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Oh... right. Uh... Don't worry about it. I just thought maybe you already knew about... never mind boss.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh... right. Uh... Don't worry about it. I just thought maybe you already knew about... never mind boss.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31515","byteOffset":19803840,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_AB613F72","articyId":"72057645577587307","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"It ain't my place, boss. If I say more I could be boiling some toads, you know?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It ain't my place, boss. If I say more I could be boiling some toads, you know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18254","byteOffset":14792616,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_868A4434","articyId":"72057645577587329","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Look, you're my boss and you can fire me, but there was stuff about Thaddeus that... well he has to tell you himself. You can't hear it from me.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, you're my boss and you can fire me, but there was stuff about Thaddeus that... well he has to tell you himself. You can't hear it from me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2875.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48258","byteOffset":32593240,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_A40DE39F","articyId":"72057645577587343","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"There are two questions people got about Thaddeus: \"Where is he?\", and “Why did he leave?” It might only be possible to answer one of those questions, so you better decide which one means more to you.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There are two questions people got about Thaddeus: \"Where is he?\", and “Why did he leave?” It might only be possible to answer one of those questions, so you better decide which one means more to you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27698","byteOffset":18359880,"byteLength":548}},{"id":"DFr_E3D8B450","articyId":"72057645577587364","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"I don't know more than anyone else. But sometimes, even though he's gone, it feels like he left to look out for us. And sometimes, it feels like he didn't go anywhere - he went everywhere.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know more than anyone else. But sometimes, even though he's gone, it feels like he left to look out for us. And sometimes, it feels like he didn't go anywhere - he went everywhere.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4075.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30292","byteOffset":19340272,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_EF0A2FC8","articyId":"72057645577587264","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?","TextSheVersion":"What?","TextTheyVersion":"What?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":775.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28486","byteOffset":18659816,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_8E31BAD0","articyId":"72057645577587278","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What is Egress?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What is Egress?","TextSheVersion":"What is Egress?","TextTheyVersion":"What is Egress?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45110","byteOffset":31399096,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_3936F6E0","articyId":"72057645577587285","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Banor","text":"Just an old man's ramblings. Pay me no mind.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just an old man's ramblings. Pay me no mind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1675.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25991","byteOff